 you're plugged in  but the update to the dot view app with  this m9 brings some legit new kind of  features to the case so first of all  there are new themes and these kind of  change the way you see the time when you  check that in dot view so you can still  use the default theme which is plain  text weather and the time but then you  have a bunch of these other colorful  pre-loaded themes so you can get a  little bit more interesting in the way  it looks when you check the time with  dot view there's also these Holly  they based pre-loaded themes I don't  know if I want to use these but you can  have them automatically activate when  the holidays arrive so if that's what  you're into you can have your phone  surprise you like that and there's also  some live themes which basically are  just short animations so if I choose one  here you can see when I apply it it  gives me a little bit of motion when I  check the time so I'm not sure how many  people still want that but it's there so  you can also make your own theme pretty  easily just hit the plus up top and then  you can actually just take a picture of  anything with the camera does a pretty  good job of reproducing it in a sort of  a dot view way so if you get a couple of  nice-looking colors some contrast in  there you can crop it set it and sure  enough from an arm's distance it  actually looks like whatever you take a  picture of and so you can do this really  quickly and easily just like that so I  made a quick theme of the facet just in  Malheur made that's on my wall right now  just by taking a picture I even did one  of the shirt I'm wearing today so if  that isn't dope and pretty easy to do I  don't know what is  now after themes you have a couple of  other things you have apps and there are  just three right now but I'd expect more  to show up in the Play Store eventually  dot messages is pretty simple lets you  pick a color text and background and  then play whatever message you type  through the dot view cover on repeat  Scrolls pretty smoothly  pretty neat even if you don't have a  purpose other than it just looking cool  and then dot design is another way to  draw your own themes so it gives you a  few free templates to trace over and  make your own drawings on the dot view  theme I'm not very good at drawing or  even tracing so I kind of stuck to the  preloaded ones with that options there  and then there's my favorite and it's  actually a game it's called HTC dot  breaker  Oh  so admittedly this probably isn't the  best gaming experience the one m9 is  capable of but it's still pretty cool  and it's something you can break out as  I guess conversation starter or to get a  while out of someone and honestly what  cooler features can you show me in a  smartphone case so I'm playing freaking  brick breaker on my phone without even  opening the case it's crazy bottom line  I have the same recommendation as last  time with this dive view case really I'm  not the biggest guy into cases on a  smartphone but if first party cases all  had this much effort put into them I'd  be very happy so thanks for watching and  I'll talk to you guys in the next one  peace
 

